      "description": "browserhive: trace/events.jsonl, the trace of the capture, is present and declared in resources; browserhive:capture.trace says how many lines it holds; each line is a JSON object carrying the members BrowserHive WACZ Profile 1.23.0 defines — profile browserhive:trace/1, kind request, id, hop, url, method, startedAt as an RFC 3339 timestamp, ms, and outcome from its fixed values; lines that share an id are in ascending order of hop; a line of a request that was not archived or was denied holds nothing of the answer; record, when present, names a response record in archive/ whose WARC-Date is the startedAt of the line; and when the trace left no line out, every http(s) response record is named by a line (WACZ Profile 1.23.0)",
      "descriptionKey": "browserhive/trace-shape.desc",
