      "description": "browserhive: logs/capture.jsonl, the log of the capture, is present, and each of its lines is a JSON object carrying the members BrowserHive WACZ Profile 1.19.0 defines — profile browserhive:log/1, at as an RFC 3339 timestamp, ms as an integer of 0 or more that never falls below the line before, source and level from their fixed values, msg as a string; script on exactly the lines whose source is script, naming an entry of settings.behaviors; dpr, when present, one of settings.devicePixelRatios; truncated, when present, a boolean — and the log holds no line from the page when document carries withheld (WACZ Profile 1.19.0)",
      "descriptionKey": "browserhive/logs-shape.desc",
