      "description": "browserhive: browserhive:capture.robotsOverride, if the package carries it, is an object that holds every member BrowserHive WACZ Profile 1.29.0 defines, each a string — exemptionId and grantedBy of 1 character or more, reason of 1 to 500 Unicode code points, pathPattern beginning with /, scope seeds or links, and grantedAt and expiresAt each an RFC 3339 date-time in UTC. The member is optional, and a package without it is not reported. It is a declaration of the requester, and the producer checks nothing of it but this form: whether robots.txt disallowed the URL, and whether the exemption exists, covers the URL or was in force, cannot be told from the package.",
