      "description": "browserhive: checks the shape of browserhive:capture.dismissal when it is present. It must carry the selectors and heuristic that were in force even when nothing was removed — an empty list of removals reads the same whether twenty selectors were tried or none, so the outcome is only checkable next to the input. And a removal that could not be carried out must state that instead of reporting an empty result, because it observed nothing.",
