      "description": "browserhive: checks browserhive:capture.settle against BrowserHive WACZ Profile 1.7.0. It must be present, since the wait runs on every capture. Every signal's time must be written, as null when the signal was not satisfied: an omitted time reads as a signal nobody watched. And endedBy must agree with the times — "quiet" beside a null, or "deadline" with none, is a claim the capture did not earn.",
      "descriptionKey": "browserhive/settle-shape.desc",
      "docs": [
