      "description": "browserhive: reports an archive whose wait after navigation ran into its deadline, naming the signals that were not satisfied. This is not a violation — BrowserHive WACZ Profile 1.7.0 says a deadline is not a failure, and the package holds what the page had become by then. It is shown because a reader weighing the archive as evidence needs to know the page was still changing when it was taken, and nothing else in the archive says so.",
